Sensors
All of the robots in the videos we have seen have something in common - they can “sense” their surroundings, and act on what they find.
Sensing Distance
Distance is easy to measure if we take some concepts from nature.
The speed of sound
Our Arduino code measures microseconds, so we will us 0.034 to get centimeters/microsecond.
Adding Sensors to Your Prototype
This function can be called anywhere in our code to get the current distance.
